WEBVTT

00:01:57.433 --> 00:01:59.573
I'm starting to get hungry.

00:01:59.766 --> 00:02:01.726
Didn't you just eat?

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:03.700
I'm hungry too, maro!

00:02:03.766 --> 00:02:05.326
I'm thirsty!

00:02:05.633 --> 00:02:06.873
You guys are hopeless.

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:09.930
So, we finally meet...

00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:15.333
Who're you?

00:02:17.833 --> 00:02:18.933
Homeron!

00:02:21.033 --> 00:02:25.933
THE CAPTIVE KNIGHT

00:02:26.166 --> 00:02:27.226
You can see it, right?

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:28.830
That's Castillo De La Testa,

00:02:28.866 --> 00:02:31.926
one of the Grankingdom's
outlying fortresses.

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:34.670
Within that base is
a powerful control system,

00:02:34.700 --> 00:02:36.930
- capable of accessing the very heart
- Let me see, maro!

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.430
- of their information network.
- Hold it!

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:42.500
As a result, the security there is
tighter than other bases.

00:02:42.966 --> 00:02:46.266
What we know about
the Extra Seven right now

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:50.230
is that someone powerful is
behind the one who stole it.

00:02:50.866 --> 00:02:52.396
The Grankingdom?

00:02:52.966 --> 00:02:54.466
There's a possibility.

00:02:54.733 --> 00:02:56.073
But we're not certain...

00:02:56.633 --> 00:02:59.303
The only way to learn more
about it is to infiltrate

00:02:59.333 --> 00:03:03.533
that Castillo De La Testa and
use their master computer.

00:03:04.333 --> 00:03:05.003
In other words...

00:03:05.366 --> 00:03:08.696
We won't get any more information
regarding the Extra Seven

00:03:08.733 --> 00:03:10.403
unless we go in there.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:12.130
That's right!

00:03:26.433 --> 00:03:28.073
Morning, Knight Master.

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:32.200
How was the comfort of
the large room I prepared for you?

00:03:33.033 --> 00:03:34.533
You're getting VIP treatment.

00:03:36.933 --> 00:03:40.773
Nice to meet you. I'm your caretaker
for the moment.

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:43.430
I'm Cynthia, and I serve
under General Logi.

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:46.470
I'm in charge of this
Arkaz Detention Facility.

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:49.500
Oh, my. How scary.

00:03:49.633 --> 00:03:51.703
If you look at me like that...

00:03:54.833 --> 00:03:57.103
My true nature might come out.

00:04:03.066 --> 00:04:04.066
Say what?!

00:04:04.533 --> 00:04:05.573
Conrad was...?!

00:04:06.133 --> 00:04:11.133
Yes. It's fresh information
I just got before I met you guys.

00:04:11.766 --> 00:04:14.296
It appears he's in
the Arkaz Detention Facility.

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:16.130
Arkaz Detention Facility?

00:04:16.866 --> 00:04:21.426
It's like a prison and it's not that far
from the Castillo De La Testa.

00:04:22.133 --> 00:04:23.133
No way.

00:04:23.766 --> 00:04:27.866
All right. Then let's head for
the Arkaz Detention Facility.

00:04:28.333 --> 00:04:29.003
What?

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:32.070
Of course!
We have to go save Conrad!

00:04:32.666 --> 00:04:33.866
There's that, but...

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:35.870
What are you thinking?

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:39.430
We'll act like we're going to
save Lord Conrad

00:04:39.466 --> 00:04:42.066
and launch an all-out attack on
the Arkaz Detention Facility.

00:04:42.366 --> 00:04:45.066
If we do that, soldiers will
come rushing in

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:47.300
from all over the surrounding area
to join the fight.

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:48.600
In other words...

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:51.330
What does that mean?

00:04:52.800 --> 00:04:53.970
A diversionary tactic.

00:04:54.533 --> 00:04:56.503
So we serve as the decoy

00:04:56.533 --> 00:05:00.273
and Homeron slips
into Castillo De La Testa?

00:05:01.633 --> 00:05:02.303
Can you do it?

00:05:04.733 --> 00:05:05.933
I guess I have no choice.

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:08.170
There doesn't seem to
be any other solution.

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:10.770
We'll attract the Grankingdom army!

00:05:11.133 --> 00:05:12.633
We're counting on you, Homeron!

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:17.300
Jeez! That dud soldier!

00:05:17.566 --> 00:05:18.766
He's so irritating!

00:05:18.966 --> 00:05:21.166
Jeez, my makeup's crumbling!

00:05:21.733 --> 00:05:22.733
Reporting!

00:05:23.866 --> 00:05:26.466
We've got intruders coming in
from the southeast!

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:28.030
It looks like an enemy attack!

00:05:28.733 --> 00:05:29.903
What did you say?!

00:05:46.933 --> 00:05:48.533
Blitz Claw!

00:06:00.966 --> 00:06:03.126
Listen up!
Do it as flashy as you can!

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:06.000
There's no point if we don't smash
the forces here!

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:08.670
Right! Let's go, Blue Dragon!

00:06:08.933 --> 00:06:10.203
She said to do it flashy!

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:13.000
Now you're talking!

00:06:21.633 --> 00:06:25.303
Thanks. That's far enough for you guys.

00:06:25.666 --> 00:06:27.296
Will you be okay, Homeron?

00:06:27.633 --> 00:06:30.373
We'll go with you as far as we can.

00:06:30.833 --> 00:06:32.033
That would be dangerous.

00:06:32.566 --> 00:06:35.066
It'll do more harm than good
if they find us.

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:36.070
But...

00:06:36.466 --> 00:06:38.696
I'm the best master informant
in the world!

00:06:39.333 --> 00:06:42.673
I'll nail down the location of
the Extra Seven, no matter what!

00:06:43.633 --> 00:06:45.103
Don't worry and just wait!

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:56.500
Reporting!

00:06:56.833 --> 00:06:58.103
Our losses are growing.

00:06:58.466 --> 00:07:00.596
The enemy assault rate is
at 45 percent!

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:03.030
It's no surprise for the Type Ones,

00:07:03.066 --> 00:07:04.726
but the Type Twos are
useless as well!

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:08.230
Send out all of the remaining forces!

00:07:08.566 --> 00:07:09.726
Hurry!

00:07:09.866 --> 00:07:10.526
Yes, ma'am!

00:07:13.333 --> 00:07:14.933
I have no choice...

00:07:23.233 --> 00:07:24.573
Maro!

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:46.470
Hey! Where are you going?!

00:07:47.333 --> 00:07:48.373
Isn't it obvious?!

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:50.000
I'm going to save Conrad!

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:52.370
Idiot! Do that later!

00:07:52.633 --> 00:07:54.203
We came to distract the enemy!

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:55.800
Shut up!

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:59.370
We can't just leave him,
knowing he's being held right nearby!

00:08:00.066 --> 00:08:02.566
Zola! Do something about this idiot!

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:05.970
I'll save Conrad, no matter what!

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:09.600
All right, go.
However, you're going with Jiro.

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:10.670
- What?!
- What?!

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:17.030
And retreat if you have to.
You make the call, Jiro.

00:08:17.333 --> 00:08:18.003
Roger!

00:08:18.433 --> 00:08:19.573
Got it, Shu?!

00:08:19.833 --> 00:08:23.003
Yeah! Let's go, Jiro!
Follow me!

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:25.470
Don't order me around!

00:08:37.900 --> 00:08:40.200
Here they come! Close the gate!

00:08:40.233 --> 00:08:41.233
Darn it!

00:08:41.433 --> 00:08:42.433
I don't think so!

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:52.070
Nice, Jiro! All right! Follow me!

00:08:52.266 --> 00:08:54.126
I told you not to order me around!

00:08:57.233 --> 00:08:59.503
First and Second Platoon,
prepare to sortie!

00:08:59.766 --> 00:09:02.296
Third and Fourth Platoon,
you're on third battle deployment!

00:09:02.866 --> 00:09:03.526
Yes, sir!

00:09:08.233 --> 00:09:09.803
Things are getting hectic.

00:09:10.433 --> 00:09:12.233
It seems Shu and the others
are doing well...

00:09:19.366 --> 00:09:20.366
Now, hurry!

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:21.400
Thanks!

00:09:24.833 --> 00:09:26.633
Conrad isn't here...

00:09:27.333 --> 00:09:31.533
Lord Conrad might be held in
a separate room in the back.

00:09:31.833 --> 00:09:33.533
Got it! I'll go check it out!

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:36.700
Hey! Did you hear that, Jiro?!
Follow me!

00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:40.770
I told you not to order me around!

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:43.070
Is this the place?!

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:49.770
There he is!

00:09:50.566 --> 00:09:51.566
Conrad!

00:09:52.133 --> 00:09:54.033
Conrad! Are you okay?!

00:09:54.133 --> 00:09:55.133
Conrad!

00:09:57.333 --> 00:09:58.703
Y-You guys...

00:09:58.900 --> 00:09:59.930
We've come to save you!

00:10:00.966 --> 00:10:01.626
Let's hurry!

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:03.070
Can you walk?

00:10:03.633 --> 00:10:04.303
Yes.

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:06.230
I appreciate it. Thanks.

00:10:16.033 --> 00:10:18.003
Aww, boys...

00:10:18.933 --> 00:10:21.933
Where are you going with
the dud soldier?

00:10:30.966 --> 00:10:32.666
Ray Stinger!

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:36.800
Blitz Claw!

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:44.870
I'm tired, maro.

00:10:44.966 --> 00:10:46.366
We've caused this much
damage to them.

00:10:46.433 --> 00:10:49.403
Even the Castillo De La Testa
should be taking some action...

00:10:50.833 --> 00:10:51.873
Zola! Look at that!

00:10:52.466 --> 00:10:53.466
They're coming, maro!

00:10:53.633 --> 00:10:54.633
Reinforcements, huh?

00:10:55.466 --> 00:10:56.596
We did it, maro!

00:10:56.633 --> 00:10:59.333
Now we just have to wait for Shu
and the others to come back.

00:10:59.533 --> 00:11:00.273
No...

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:01.070
Maro?

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:03.970
The Castillo De La Testa isn't
in that direction.

00:11:05.066 --> 00:11:06.826
This is more than we bargained for...

00:11:23.333 --> 00:11:24.333
You...!

00:11:24.666 --> 00:11:27.766
Oh. So you remembered me, eh, kid?

00:11:27.866 --> 00:11:29.566
I'm so glad!

00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:34.400
And the boy there.
Nice to meet you, I guess?

00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:37.100
Jiro, do you know this old lady?

00:11:37.266 --> 00:11:40.626
I'm not an old lady!
I'm a young lady!

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:42.500
Scary...!

00:11:42.666 --> 00:11:44.896
She's a member of
Logi's Flying Squadron.

00:11:45.333 --> 00:11:46.003
Logi's...?!

00:11:46.766 --> 00:11:49.696
Women should behave
more gracefully.

00:11:52.333 --> 00:11:53.003
Who's that?

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:54.770
He's also one of Logi's men!

00:11:55.966 --> 00:11:57.066
Two of them?

00:11:57.133 --> 00:12:00.173
Shut up. You're late, Lemaire.

00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:02.800
It's because you contacted me
at the very last minute.

00:12:03.266 --> 00:12:05.866
I'm not your boyfriend,
you know.

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:09.370
It seems you came rushing
over though.

00:12:09.666 --> 00:12:12.026
You didn't want me to take
all the credit, right?

00:12:13.666 --> 00:12:17.196
I don't think you can take
them out by yourself.

00:12:17.600 --> 00:12:19.800
So you sought my help.

00:12:20.233 --> 00:12:21.233
Am I wrong?

00:12:21.433 --> 00:12:24.133
Your sarcasm is first-class as usual.

00:12:24.833 --> 00:12:25.833
Now then...

00:12:26.266 --> 00:12:29.596
You two appear to be
Miss Zola's students.

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:30.830
Then what of it?!

00:12:31.266 --> 00:12:34.066
I want to have a bout with Miss Zola.

00:12:34.666 --> 00:12:36.926
But for now,
defeating her students will do.

00:12:36.966 --> 00:12:38.596
It'll make a good demonstration to her.

00:12:45.933 --> 00:12:48.833
If you have anything to say to her,
you might want to tell me now.

00:12:49.300 --> 00:12:51.130
I'll be sure to pass it along.

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:54.070
After all, neither of you is
ever going to see her again.

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:55.430
Say what?!

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.970
I'll see Zola and tell her myself!

00:13:07.533 --> 00:13:09.403
That I beat you guys!

00:13:11.766 --> 00:13:13.296
Let's do it, Blue Dragon!

00:13:13.366 --> 00:13:15.126
Yeah! I'm ready when you are!

00:13:15.433 --> 00:13:16.703
No! We're retreating!

00:13:16.966 --> 00:13:17.626
What...?

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:19.730
Give them one good shot
and we're retreating!

00:13:19.866 --> 00:13:22.226
What're you saying?!
I'm not running away!

00:13:22.466 --> 00:13:25.866
It's my call!
Just follow my orders!

00:13:27.133 --> 00:13:31.173
Unfortunately, you have no place to
return to even if you were to retreat.

00:13:31.566 --> 00:13:32.226
What did you say?!

00:13:33.266 --> 00:13:36.666
Military forces under my command
have Miss Zola completely surrounded.

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:40.530
Even she can't hold on
without you guys...

00:13:58.933 --> 00:14:01.173
Even if she does live through...

00:14:01.466 --> 00:14:04.526
You boys won't be able
to run away from us.

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:13.170
We'll show you...

00:14:13.300 --> 00:14:14.670
The extent of our power.

00:14:24.666 --> 00:14:25.666
Minotaur!

00:14:25.866 --> 00:14:26.866
Roger!

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:28.130
I'll fight too!

00:14:28.766 --> 00:14:31.866
I might have a chance of taking them out
if I don't try to save my life.

00:14:32.133 --> 00:14:33.903
No. You can't in your condition.

00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:36.000
Please leave this to us.

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:38.170
Don't worry about my condition.

00:14:38.466 --> 00:14:40.226
It's a life I've lost once to begin with.

00:14:40.466 --> 00:14:43.866
There are still lots of people
who need you!

00:14:45.266 --> 00:14:47.996
We'll be counting on you
to get the other prisoners...

00:14:48.733 --> 00:14:49.403
Got it.

00:14:50.033 --> 00:14:51.033
Don't die!

00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:04.770
Shu!

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:09.800
Oh, boy. I told you before to
make sure you look at me!

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:13.670
I don't want to look at an old lady
with that much makeup on!

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:16.730
I'll stop that!

00:15:16.933 --> 00:15:19.473
Don't talk to me like that, boy!

00:15:23.366 --> 00:15:25.126
Bad call.

00:15:25.233 --> 00:15:27.133
Trying to stop us with power like that...

00:15:27.233 --> 00:15:28.773
It's totally impossible!

00:15:39.466 --> 00:15:41.166
I don't hear anything
moving in there.

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:42.400
What does it mean?!

00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:47.200
It'd be dangerous to
stand by here like this.

00:15:48.600 --> 00:15:49.930
Should I retreat for now?!

00:15:50.766 --> 00:15:53.866
But I must not miss the chance
when that door opens...

00:15:56.133 --> 00:15:58.733
Don't move! What're you doing?

00:15:59.733 --> 00:16:00.803
Damn it.

00:16:04.666 --> 00:16:07.296
Shu! I'll go first, soâ€”

00:16:09.666 --> 00:16:11.466
Idiot! Listen to what I say!

00:16:23.333 --> 00:16:26.173
It seems you're struggling already.
That's no good.

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:28.770
Miss Zola is strong and beautiful.

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:31.670
You guys are still inexperienced
compared to that.

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:33.900
Shu! Don't interfere!

00:16:35.433 --> 00:16:36.503
Shut up!

00:16:48.766 --> 00:16:51.266
Hey! At least stop getting in the way!

00:16:52.766 --> 00:16:54.326
They can't pull together!

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:03.330
We're not going to fall for
the same attack over and over!

00:17:03.733 --> 00:17:05.533
Who said they're the same?

00:17:13.866 --> 00:17:17.066
Who're you? What're you doing here?

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:20.570
We've been given permission
to fire on suspicious individuals.

00:17:20.966 --> 00:17:21.966
Nothing personal.

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:39.170
What is it?!

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:40.200
What's going on?!

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:43.030
Oh! Nothing!

00:17:44.100 --> 00:17:45.570
I just accidentally fired my gun.

00:17:45.866 --> 00:17:46.526
What?

00:17:46.566 --> 00:17:48.696
J-Just get back to your post.

00:17:56.066 --> 00:17:57.066
You guys!

00:17:57.666 --> 00:17:59.266
Are you okay, Homeron?!

00:18:00.366 --> 00:18:03.396
Thanks. But it's too dangerous here.

00:18:04.133 --> 00:18:06.173
I bet something happened
to Shu and the others.

00:18:06.666 --> 00:18:08.126
We should retreat...

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:09.970
Wait, Homeron!

00:18:11.866 --> 00:18:14.126
Shu will do it.
He'll definitely do it!

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:19.070
Hey! He's my fiancÃ©!

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:22.030
Don't talk about him like he's yours!

00:18:22.166 --> 00:18:25.566
Jeez, you're annoying.

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:26.270
You're right.

00:18:28.233 --> 00:18:30.173
Shu will definitely do it.

00:18:30.933 --> 00:18:33.773
It's as you say. That kid will do it.

00:18:38.833 --> 00:18:40.433
It's like a game.

00:18:40.466 --> 00:18:41.566
Totally.

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:42.600
Damn it.

00:18:42.833 --> 00:18:44.673
Even at your level,

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:47.430
you can fight this much if
you pair up with me...

00:18:48.033 --> 00:18:50.073
What do you mean by "my level"?

00:18:50.233 --> 00:18:51.233
Excuse me.

00:18:51.333 --> 00:18:54.203
Your foul mouth sure is
super first-class!

00:18:54.633 --> 00:18:56.973
Your mean personality
measures up pretty well, too.

00:18:57.033 --> 00:18:58.403
How annoying!

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:02.270
Now then, shall we finish
this up soon?

00:19:02.833 --> 00:19:06.373
I'm disappointed, boys.
It wasn't much of a challenge.

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:07.500
What?!

00:19:07.566 --> 00:19:12.196
Shu... These guys are strong.
We'll lose at this rate.

00:19:14.366 --> 00:19:15.426
What should we do?

00:19:15.833 --> 00:19:17.503
There's just one thing
we can do to win, right?

00:19:19.633 --> 00:19:21.433
Yeah, there's just one!

00:19:25.533 --> 00:19:26.533
You never learn...

00:19:31.066 --> 00:19:33.266
Listen! Don't go charging in this time!

00:19:33.433 --> 00:19:34.433
Switch to backup!

00:19:34.466 --> 00:19:35.696
Got it!

00:19:40.666 --> 00:19:41.796
Here!

00:19:44.166 --> 00:19:44.826
What?!

00:19:50.566 --> 00:19:51.726
Now, Shu!

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:52.470
Right!

00:20:12.300 --> 00:20:13.830
Useless mace.

00:20:14.666 --> 00:20:16.666
You rely on weapons too much!

00:20:16.866 --> 00:20:19.896
Silence. Then I shall fight seriously...

00:20:25.900 --> 00:20:27.970
Now, shall we put an end
to this pretty soon?

00:20:28.333 --> 00:20:29.373
Same here.

00:20:31.866 --> 00:20:34.526
Miss Zola...!
Did you take out my entire force?!

00:20:35.033 --> 00:20:37.373
Yeah. It did take a little time, though.

00:20:37.766 --> 00:20:40.326
There were a lot of them,
but they were only robots, after all.

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:42.170
Not much of a problem.

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:45.330
The tables have turned.

00:20:47.133 --> 00:20:48.633
Excellent, Miss Zola.

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:52.600
We must acknowledge that
we've miscalculated.

00:20:52.900 --> 00:20:57.030
However, you didn't think that we could
call more reinforcements, did you?

00:20:57.366 --> 00:20:58.026
What?!

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:02.370
We should be getting reinforcements from
Castillo De La Testa right around now.

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:04.600
Now, what will you do?

00:21:04.866 --> 00:21:06.496
That's a problem.

00:21:07.300 --> 00:21:09.530
Then let's pull out.

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:12.570
Hornet Assassin!

00:21:23.766 --> 00:21:24.766
You!

00:21:33.666 --> 00:21:34.666
Yes!

00:21:34.700 --> 00:21:36.070
The door opened!

00:21:36.833 --> 00:21:38.073
I'm off, then!

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:39.870
Homeron, be careful!

00:21:40.566 --> 00:21:41.566
Good luck!

00:21:49.000 --> 00:21:51.330
Conrad! I'm glad you're okay!

00:21:51.700 --> 00:21:54.930
Yes. I owe you. Thank you.

00:21:55.166 --> 00:21:57.466
Oh, it's not a big thing.

00:21:57.966 --> 00:22:01.126
Besides, it wasn't just me...

00:22:09.366 --> 00:22:10.896
Guys!

00:22:11.933 --> 00:22:14.003
It was a big success on our end, too!

00:22:14.033 --> 00:22:15.603
- Kluke!
- Shu!

00:22:15.633 --> 00:22:16.773
Darling!

00:22:17.800 --> 00:22:18.470
Whoa!

00:22:18.500 --> 00:22:20.570
Thank goodness you're safe, darling.

00:22:20.600 --> 00:22:22.430
Stop it.

00:24:21.166 --> 00:24:23.126
Homeron carries out
some dangerous spy activities.

00:24:23.266 --> 00:24:25.896
However, Shu and the others
make a serious mistake.

00:24:26.133 --> 00:24:28.133
We didn't give Homeron
his equipment!

00:24:28.166 --> 00:24:30.926
What? There was
a fake moustache in there.

00:24:30.966 --> 00:24:32.966
He wouldn't even have
Makibishi spikes or the magic hand.

00:24:33.000 --> 00:24:34.000
That's reckless!

00:24:34.033 --> 00:24:35.903
What will happen to him?

00:24:36.200 --> 00:24:39.200
Next on Blue Dragon:
"The Informant's Pursuit"
